{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hero's party has been<i> annihilated</i>.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only save ONE, but they are all BROKEN:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero lost their words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mage lost their magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warrior lost their body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Priest lost ****.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovable &amp; Broken Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven, story-rich RPG with 4 distinct character routes. Find your favorite &quot;broken&quot; one to save\u2026and leave the others behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/a9d37134a577d224f84dd15a5c911662.poster.avif?t=1772013198\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/a9d37134a577d224f84dd15a5c911662.webm?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/a9d37134a577d224f84dd15a5c911662.mp4?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark &amp; Cute Art</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable art fuses with dark horror effects. The cuter the graphics, the deeper the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/dd01718d33fc755ea211c7cf3b94f5ed.poster.avif?t=1772013198\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/dd01718d33fc755ea211c7cf3b94f5ed.webm?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/dd01718d33fc755ea211c7cf3b94f5ed.mp4?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timing-Based Card Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is key. Manage limited resources and push the button at the perfect moment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/cfeda462f1f0751be944809795e8b741.poster.avif?t=1772013198\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/cfeda462f1f0751be944809795e8b741.webm?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/cfeda462f1f0751be944809795e8b741.mp4?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script Volume: 200,000+ words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite-flavored dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High lethality, instant retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgiving random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based card battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes to beat the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter your weapon to deal more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;Curse&quot; to rewrite your destiny</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2638080?t=1772013198","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2638080?t=1772013198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/7b4c634b0a51cf49110cd4be27ced19ad33baec5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772013198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/7b4c634b0a51cf49110cd4be27ced19ad33baec5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772013198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Contains bloodshed, death, a bit of horror, and psycho-horror elements. Please be careful if you do not like them. However, if you expect too much of these elements, you may be disappointed."},"demos":[{"appid":4099940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hero's party has been<i> annihilated</i>.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only save ONE, but they are all BROKEN:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hero lost their words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mage lost their magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Warrior lost their body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the Priest lost ****.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lovable &amp; Broken Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven, story-rich RPG with 4 distinct character routes. Find your favorite &quot;broken&quot; one to save\u2026and leave the others behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/a9d37134a577d224f84dd15a5c911662.poster.avif?t=1772013198\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/extras/a9d37134a577d224f84dd15a5c911662.webm?t=1772013198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc