rent routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script Volume: 200,000+ words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite-flavored dungeon crawling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High lethality, instant retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unforgiving random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based card battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your reflexes to beat the enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shatter your weapon to deal more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the &quot;Curse&quot; to rewrite your destiny</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u30c7\u30b9\u7d44\u5408"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2638080/e44c696c243b2fc64b65eb2ef439ef3535ba1e40/header.jpg?t=1772013198","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2638080/233281983/721f0827ac5fd22e5cc80f7d7e440e36c7b3d074/1771291104/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771293353","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2638080/233281983/721f0827ac5fd22e5cc80f7d7e440e36c7b3d074/1771291104/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771293353","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2638080/233281983/721f0827ac5fd22e5cc80f7d7e440e36c7b3d074/1771291104/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771293353","id":257288484,"name":"Trailer_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257288484/1cfb7680f610372aa07bdc31dd53439d51c801de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771293353"}],"name":"Annihilated","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</